    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread operation failure error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1ThreadFailError" kindref="compound">ThreadFailError</ref> represents an error where a thread could not be created, joined, or otherwise managed correctly.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ThreadFailError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>ThreadFailError(&quot;Thread<sp/>creation<sp/>failed&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
